 "brief": "Three members of the Abideen family were killed in an Israeli airstrike on al-Qarara town northeast of Khan Younis in southern Gaza, Shehab Wire reported. The strike targeted a group of farmers working in the area. All three deaths occurred on the same day.\n\nAl-Qarara lies in the northern reaches of Khan Younis, a densely populated city in southern Gaza that has experienced repeated Israeli military operations throughout the conflict. The airstrike added to the mounting casualties among Palestinian civilians in the region.",
